@startuml feature-nearest-station-weather
title Nearest Station Weather Feature Flow

actor User
participant "Weather History View" as WeatherHistoryView
participant "Weather History API" as WeatherHistoryApi
participant "Weather History Service" as WeatherHistoryService

User -> WeatherHistoryView: Open weather history feature
User -> WeatherHistoryView: Enter coordinates or choose preset location

WeatherHistoryView -> WeatherHistoryApi: Request weather history for coordinates
WeatherHistoryApi -> WeatherHistoryService: Get historical weather data

alt Weather data found
  WeatherHistoryService --> WeatherHistoryApi: Weather history data
  WeatherHistoryApi --> WeatherHistoryView: Response data
  WeatherHistoryView --> User: Show station info, charts, tables, and summary
else Weather data unavailable
  WeatherHistoryService --> WeatherHistoryApi: Error or empty result
  WeatherHistoryApi --> WeatherHistoryView: Error response
  WeatherHistoryView --> User: Show error or empty state
end

@enduml